{"sha":"e6a21a14106d9718aa4f8e115b1e474888eeba44","node_id":"C_kwDOACN7MtoAKGU2YTIxYTE0MTA2ZDk3MThhYTRmOGUxMTViMWU0NzQ4ODhlZWJhNDQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Jiasheng Jiang","email":"jiasheng@iscas.ac.cn","date":"2022-01-14T06:28:40Z"},"committer":{"name":"Mauro Carvalho Chehab","email":"mchehab@kernel.org","date":"2022-03-07T10:06:19Z"},"message":"media: vidtv: Check for null return of vzalloc\n\nAs the possible failure of the vzalloc(), e->encoder_buf might be NULL.\nTherefore, it should be better to check it in order\nto guarantee the success of the initialization.\nIf fails, we need to free not only 'e' but also 'e->name'.\nAlso, if the allocation for ctx fails, we need to free 'e->encoder_buf'\nelse.\n\nFixes: f90cf6079bf6 (\"media: vidtv: add a bridge driver\")\nSigned-off-by: Jiasheng Jiang <jiasheng@iscas.ac.cn>\nSigned-off-by: Hans Verkuil <hverkuil-cisco@xs4all.nl>\nSigned-off-by: Mauro Carvalho Chehab <mchehab@kernel.org>","tree":{"sha":"c9d9fe68b0886e1a16cc5365e0ce690f458109d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/trees/c9d9fe68b0886e1a16cc5365e0ce690f458109d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/commits/e6a21a14106d9718aa4f8e115b1e474888eeba44","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/e6a21a14106d9718aa4f8e115b1e474888eeba44","html_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/e6a21a14106d9718aa4f8e115b1e474888eeba44","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/e6a21a14106d9718aa4f8e115b1e474888eeba44/comments","author":{"login":"JiangJias","id":93125159,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYz6Jw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93125159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiangJias","html_url":"https://github.com/JiangJias","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiangJias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github